# Privacy Policy

**Responsible Party**
Wolfgang Rathgeb
wr@dropanote.de
Germany

**What Data is Stored?**

On my servers (Cloudflare):
- Login session (cookie)
- Basic user data from your Git provider (email, name, avatar URL)
- Project metadata (repository name, last sync)
- Cached Git data (max. 24 hours to avoid API rate limits)
- Possibly language cookie (set by paraglide)

Your content stays in your Git repository. I only access it when you actively use the CMS.

**No Data Sharing**
Your data is not sold or shared with third parties. Access only happens through your Git provider's API.

**Analytics**
Privacy-focused analytics via Umami (self-hosted, no personal data, no tracking cookies).

**Deletion**
Account deletion not yet implemented. Cached data is automatically deleted after max. 24 hours. You can revoke access anytime in your GitHub settings.

**Your Rights (GDPR)**
You have the right to access, correct, and delete your data. Contact: wr@dropanote.de

**Changes**
This privacy policy may be updated. Last updated: October 2024
